" title=\"Earth\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Earth <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Poisoned Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poisoned_Icon_Big_f04eb1.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:100.0000%; background-color:#27c429; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.0000%); display:inline-block;\">110%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Drown\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Drown <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Drowning Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Drowning_Icon_Big_f65e47.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:90.9091%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 9.0909%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Healing\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Healing <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Healing Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:90.9091%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 9.0909%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Ulderek%27s%20Rock\">Orc Fortress</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Foreigner%20Quarter\">Foreigner Quarter</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Zao%20Orc%20Land\">Zao Orc Land</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tThe Orc Warlord will chase the enemy while throwing <a href=\"#/wiki/Throwing%20Star\">stars</a>. They retarget and will kill weaker <a href=\"#/wiki/Creatures\">creatures</a> to reach you.<br/><br/>An orc warlord attacks in melee range.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tTo beat these powerful creatures you will need a good team with high-skilled <a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Knights</a>, some <a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">Paladins</a> and Mages with a high Magic Level. The best way to kill them is from a distance because their <a href=\"#/wiki/Throwing%20Star\">Throwing Stars</a> are weaker than their melee. <a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Knights</a> with skills 90/90 and a Scrapper Arena weapon can kill them fairly easily. As with all creatures that use invisibility, stay alert with an exori ico to turn them visible again. Its attacks can be compared to a <a href=\"#/wiki/Giant%20Spider\">Giant Spider</a>'s. Orc Warlords are more profitable to hunt since Orcish Axes have become sellable, and now make up the most valuable part of the loot.<br/>Orc Warlords, notably those from raids, can yield different loot:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Tusk\">Orc Tusk</a> from Orc Warlord in raids of the <a href=\"#/quest/machinery-of-war-quest\">Machinery of War Quest</a>.</li>\n<li>Amazon Armor, Amazon Helmet and Amazon Shield from Orc Warlord in raids on <a href=\"#/wiki/Femor%20Hills\">Femor Hills</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-creature-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>Although the sprites for orc warlord were implemented on Update 7.0, the first known spawns of this creature were probably only implemented with the <a href=\"#/wiki/Ulderek%27s%20Rock\">Ulderek's Rock</a> revamp on Update 7.2.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 9,324 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Broken Helmet\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Broken_Helmet_a62009.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></span></td>\n<td>Broken Helmet</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0.25</td>\n<td class=\"loot-common\" data-sort-value=\"25.429000\" style=\"text-align:center;\">25%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td><i>Empty</i></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0.23</td>\n<td class=\"loot-common\" data-sort-value=\"23.316173\" style=\"text-align:center;\">23%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Orc Leather\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Orc_Leather_2e1411.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></span></td>\n<td>Orc Leather</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0.20</td>\n<td class=\"loot-common\" data-sort-value=\"20.152295\" style=\"text-align:center;\">20%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>